# Every Python package oracle/setup.py imports, one per line, version-pinned.
#
# The published image installs only `mcp` and `pydantic`. Anything else your
# oracle needs must be listed here AND baked into the image you point Taiga at
# — see docs/TAIGA_RUNBOOK.md section 7. A task whose oracle imports scipy will
# fail at setup_problem time against the stock image.
#
# Pin exact versions. A reward that moves with a patch release is not a reward.
#
# Example:
# numpy==2.1.3
# scipy==1.14.1
